# Reviewed AUR commits for the packages the installer builds from source.
#
# One "<package> <full 40-character commit hash>" per line. A listed package is
# cloned and checked out at exactly that commit (verified with git rev-parse)
# instead of whatever the AUR HEAD happens to be at install time. Review the
# PKGBUILD and .install at that commit before pinning it:
#     git clone https://aur.archlinux.org/<package>.git && cd <package>
#     git log -1 --format=%H        # the hash to put here
#
# Unlisted packages are still built from HEAD (with no sudo for the build).
#
# paru         0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
# onlyoffice-bin 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
